#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Could Bell's inequality only be explored with 3 equally-spaced axes $a$, "
"$b$, and $c$? Could it be done with any other number of axes? What would "
"this look like? Would it still yield a difference in probabilities predicted"
" by hidden variables vs. probabilistic quantum mechanics?\n"
msgstr ""
